.TH "PACE" "1" "2026-05-17" "0.1.0" "pace Manual"
.SH NAME
pace \- Pace -- a CLI for Garmin Connect data.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B pace
[OPTIONS] COMMAND [ARGS]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Pace -- a CLI for Garmin Connect data.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-V,\fP \-\-version
Show version and exit.
.TP
\fB\-\-install\-completion\fP
Install completion for the current shell.
.TP
\fB\-\-show\-completion\fP
Show completion for the current shell, to copy it or customize the installation.
.SH COMMANDS
.PP
\fBtoday\fP
  Daily dashboard: steps, sleep, HR, body...
  See \fBpace-today(1)\fP for full documentation on the \fBtoday\fP command.
.PP
\fBwatch\fP
  Poll a metric; trigger a hook when it...
  See \fBpace-watch(1)\fP for full documentation on the \fBwatch\fP command.
.PP
\fBactivity\fP
  Workouts and activity history.
  See \fBpace-activity(1)\fP for full documentation on the \fBactivity\fP command.
.PP
\fBauth\fP
  Authentication and token management.
  See \fBpace-auth(1)\fP for full documentation on the \fBauth\fP command.
.PP
\fBcache\fP
  Manage the local response cache.
  See \fBpace-cache(1)\fP for full documentation on the \fBcache\fP command.
.PP
\fBconfig\fP
  Inspect the user configuration.
  See \fBpace-config(1)\fP for full documentation on the \fBconfig\fP command.
.PP
\fBdevice\fP
  Registered Garmin devices.
  See \fBpace-device(1)\fP for full documentation on the \fBdevice\fP command.
.PP
\fBgear\fP
  Gear inventory and usage.
  See \fBpace-gear(1)\fP for full documentation on the \fBgear\fP command.
.PP
\fBgoal\fP
  User goals and personal records.
  See \fBpace-goal(1)\fP for full documentation on the \fBgoal\fP command.
.PP
\fBprofile\fP
  User profile information.
  See \fBpace-profile(1)\fP for full documentation on the \fBprofile\fP command.
.PP
\fBtraining\fP
  Training load and performance metrics.
  See \fBpace-training(1)\fP for full documentation on the \fBtraining\fP command.
.PP
\fBwellness\fP
  Daily health metrics.
  See \fBpace-wellness(1)\fP for full documentation on the \fBwellness\fP command.
